{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-ztu5-5upp-w3kk-bmvy","published":"2026-11-11T19:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-20T02:15:08.232515027Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-120642"],"summary":"CGI versions before 5.00 for Perl return request-derived values untainted under taint mode.","details":"CGI versions before 5.00 for Perl return request-derived values untainted under taint mode.\n\nThe upload filename, uploadInfo values, some path_info and script_name values, Accept results, and the name lists from url_param and cookie are returned without the taint flag, as is a cookie named expires from 4.67 on.\n\nThese values come from regex captures or hash keys, which Perl does not taint, so they pass -T checks unvalidated.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"perl-cgi","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/perl-cgi"},"versions":["4.72-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-ztu5-5upp-w3kk-bmvy.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-ztu5-5upp-w3kk-bmvy"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-120642"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/9/ALSA-2026-99215.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:99215"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/8/ALSA-2026-99849.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:99849"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2026-120642"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://alas.aws.amazon.com/AL2/ALAS-2026-4140.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-120650"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-120648"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-120647"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.c